        "Id1": {
            "text": "It\u2019s Great to Be Young is a 1956 film that lasts 94 minutes. It was directed by Cyril Frankel and its writer was Ted Willis. John Mills played in the film, and it collected 282,838 at the box office. The film music was written by Louis Levy, and Gilbert Taylor served as a cinematographer."
        },
